                <p>Document exception for dots in <proper>S3</proper> bucket names when <setting>repo-s3-uri-style=path</setting>.</p>
            </release-item>

            <release-item>
                <commit subject="Stop setting hot_standby in the user guide."/>

                <release-item-contributor-list>
                    <release-item-contributor id="david.steele"/>
                </release-item-contributor-list>

                <p>Remove explicit <pg-setting>hot_standby</pg-setting> configuration from user guide.</p>
